---

<Layout
  title="WORKS｜作品群一覧｜日本文化・歴史・城郭クリエイター 錦乃"
  description="錦乃の制作作品群一覧。江戸城や熊本城などの和風城復元再現、城下町や武家屋敷、神社仏閣、庭園、和風の町並みなど和風建築から現代、ファンタジー、キャラクター立体物に至るまで幅広いリアルな作品をご覧いただけます。"
>

<section class="bg-[#faf8f3] min-h-screen">


  <section class="relative h-[820px] overflow-hidden">

    <picture>

      <!-- Smartphone -->
      <source
        media="(max-width: 639px)"
        srcset="/images/works-bg-mobile.jpg"
      />

      <!-- PC -->
      <img
        src="/images/works-bg.jpg"
        alt="作品紹介"
        class="works-bg absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover select-none pointer-events-none"
        draggable="false"
      />

    </picture>

  </section>



  <section class="relative overflow-hidden">

    <img
      src="/images/washi-bg1.png"
      alt=""
      class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover pointer-events-none select-none"
      draggable="false"
    />

    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-white/25"></div>


    <section class="relative overflow-hidden py-20">

      <div
        class="mx-auto max-w-6xl rounded-3xl
               border border-white/40
               bg-white/10
               backdrop-blur-xl
               shadow-2xl
               px-12 py-16"
      >

        <p
          class="tracking-[0.45em] text-sm text-white"
          style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;"
        >
          WORKS
        </p>

        <h1
          class="mt-5 text-3xl md:text-5xl text-white"
          style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
        >
          作品紹介
        </h1>

        <p
          class="mt-10 max-w-3xl text-lg leading-10 text-white"
          style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
        >
          うち錦乃が制作した作品群ページです。日本の城郭や和風建築、
          和風の町並み、神社、庭園など実在する建物や歴史考証から再現・復元した景観、
          乗り物、ファンタジー、キャラクター造形に至るまでたくさん掲載しています。
          <br />
          ぜひ、お気に入りの作品を見つけてみてください。
        </p>

      </div>

    </section>


    <section
      class="relative min-h-screen overflow-hidden py-32"
    >

      <div
        class="relative mx-auto max-w-[1800px] px-8"
      >

        <div class="works-grid">

          {
            works.map((work) => (

              <a
                href={work.link}
                class="works-card"
              >

                <div class="works-image-wrap">

                  <img
                    src={work.image}
                    alt={work.title}
                    loading="lazy"
                    class="works-image"
                  />

                </div>


                <div class="works-body">

                  <p class="works-category">
                    {work.category}
                  </p>


                  <h2
                    class="works-title"
                    style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;"
                  >
                    {work.title}
                  </h2>

                </div>

              </a>

            ))
          }

        </div>

      </div>

    </section>

  </section>

</section>


<style>


:global(html) {
  color-scheme: light;
}

:global(body) {
  color-scheme: light;

  -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;
  text-size-adjust: 100%;
}


.works-bg {
  display: block;
}



.works-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr);
  gap: 20px;
  align-items: start;
}



.works-card {
  position: relative;
  display: block;

  aspect-ratio: 1 / 1;

  overflow: hidden;

  border-radius: 1.35rem;

  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.55);

  background: rgba(100, 180, 220, 0.18);

  backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
  -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(12px);

  box-shadow:
    0 10px 30px rgba(40, 100, 130, 0.12);

  transform-style: preserve-3d;

  transition:
    transform 0.45s cubic-bezier(.22, 1, .36, 1),
    box-shadow 0.45s ease;
}


.works-card:hover {
  transform:
    translateY(-8px)
    rotateX(2deg)
    rotateY(-2deg);

  box-shadow:
    0 22px 45px rgba(30, 100, 140, 0.22);
}



.works-image-wrap {
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0;

  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;

  overflow: hidden;
}


.works-image {
  display: block;

  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;

  aspect-ratio: auto;

  object-fit: cover;

  border-radius: 0;

  transition:
    transform 0.8s cubic-bezier(.22, 1, .36, 1),
    filter 0.5s ease;
}


.works-card:hover .works-image {
  transform: scale(1.045);
}



.works-body {
  position: absolute;

  inset: 0;

  z-index: 2;

  display: block;

  padding: 1.2rem;

  pointer-events: none;
}



.works-category {
  position: absolute;

  left: 1.2rem;
  bottom: 1.05rem;

  margin: 0;

  font-family:
    "Noto Sans JP",
    "Hiragino Kaku Gothic ProN",
    "Yu Gothic",
    sans-serif;

  font-size: clamp(0.7rem, 0.9vw, 1rem);

  font-weight: 600;

  letter-spacing: 0.08em;

  line-height: 1.3;

  color: #ffffff;

  text-shadow:
    0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
}


.works-title {
  position: absolute;

  top: 1.1rem;
  left: 1.1rem;

  margin: 0;

  display: inline-block;

  max-width: calc(100% - 2.2rem);

  padding:
    0.45rem
    0.7rem;

  border-radius: 0.65rem;

  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);

  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);

  backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
  -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(8px);

  font-family:
    "Noto Sans JP",
    "Hiragino Kaku Gothic ProN",
    "Yu Gothic",
    sans-serif !important;

  font-size: clamp(0.8rem, 1vw, 1.1rem);

  font-weight: 700;

  line-height: 1.25;

  letter-spacing: 0.03em;

  color: #ffffff;

  text-shadow:
    0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.22);

  box-sizing: border-box;
}



.works-card {
  forced-color-adjust: none;
  -webkit-forced-color-adjust: none;
}



@media (max-width: 639px) {

  :global(html) {
    color-scheme: light;
    -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;
    text-size-adjust: 100%;
  }

  :global(body) {
    color-scheme: light;
    -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;
    text-size-adjust: 100%;
  }

  .works-category,
  .works-title {
    color: #ffffff !important;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: #ffffff;

    forced-color-adjust: none;
    -webkit-forced-color-adjust: none;
  }

  section.relative.overflow-hidden.py-20 p,
  section.relative.overflow-hidden.py-20 h1 {
    forced-color-adjust: none;
    -webkit-forced-color-adjust: none;
  }

  section.relative.overflow-hidden.py-20 p.text-lg {
    color: #ffffff !important;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: #ffffff;
  }

}

</style>


<script>


  function applyWorksMobileStyle() {
    const grid = document.querySelector(".works-grid");

    if (!grid) return;

    if (window.innerWidth <= 639) {

      /* 2列 */
      grid.style.setProperty(
        "grid-template-columns",
        "repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr))",
        "important"
      );

      /* スマホ用カード間隔 */
      grid.style.setProperty(
        "gap",
        "16px",
        "important"
      );

      const cards = grid.querySelectorAll(".works-card");

      cards.forEach((card) => {

        /* 正方形を維持 */
        card.style.setProperty(
          "aspect-ratio",
          "1 / 1",
          "important"
        );

        /* タイトル */
        const title = card.querySelector(".works-title");

        if (title) {
          title.style.setProperty(
            "font-size",
            "12px",
            "important"
          );

          title.style.setProperty(
            "line-height",
            "1.35",
            "important"
          );

          title.style.setProperty(
            "top",
            "0.65rem",
            "important"
          );

          title.style.setProperty(
            "left",
            "0.65rem",
            "important"
          );

          title.style.setProperty(
            "max-width",
            "calc(100% - 1.3rem)",
            "important"
          );

          title.style.setProperty(
            "padding",
            "0.3rem 0.45rem",
            "important"
          );
        }

        /* カテゴリ */
        const category = card.querySelector(".works-category");

        if (category) {
          category.style.setProperty(
            "font-size",
            "11px",
            "important"
          );

          category.style.setProperty(
            "line-height",
            "1.3",
            "important"
          );

          category.style.setProperty(
            "left",
            "0.65rem",
            "important"
          );

          category.style.setProperty(
            "bottom",
            "0.65rem",
            "important"
          );
        }

      });

    }
  }

  applyWorksMobileStyle();

  window.addEventListener(
    "resize",
    applyWorksMobileStyle
  );
</script>


